35,2,1,talk,Minako,,A full pass takes over an hour. That is a huge chunk of my day.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Two people cook constantly, but everyone cleans. The chat logs show resentment.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The grout gets dirty in days. And ""done"" means different things to everyone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Supplies cost 2,300 yen a month. The office cleaner is 4,200 an hour.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants stopped speaking. The outside firm needs someone home.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if two people cause the mess, should they do more?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, logically, yes. But we need a system that enforces it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, 4,200 yen an hour is expensive. Can we afford that?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, it is a lot. But maybe it is worth it for peace?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if we hire help, we must be home. That is a constraint.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,I cannot give up an hour every week. I need a solution.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I want the heavy users to carry the weight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I just want the bathroom to stay clean.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I want to know who pays. I do not want to be out of pocket.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,I want us to remain friends.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
